/2015/03/blog-post_47.html\" target=\"_blank\">記念新竹市母語推廣協會創辦人</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_47.html\" target=\"_blank\">——米拉（林秀珊）</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張日東</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: x-large; white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_24.html\" target=\"_blank\">粉圓叔公</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">8</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kán Ûi-iū<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/kng-thau-peh-a_31.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kng-thâu-peh--à</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/kng-thau-peh-a_31.html\" target=\"_blank\">光頭伯--à</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">40</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hô Kiaⁿ-tin<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/kng-thau-peh-a.html\" target=\"_blank\">Gōa-má</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/kng-thau-peh-a.html\" target=\"_blank\">外媽</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">42</span></div></div><div><br /></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">文學káng「台」</span></h3><div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">石牧民<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/kape-sui-kap-suae.html\" target=\"_blank\">女性kap文學ê suí kap反抗：</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/kape-sui-kap-suae.html\" target=\"_blank\">接suà講王貞文牧師ê台文小說</a></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">12</span></div></div><div><br /></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李天群</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/khah-leh.html\" target=\"_blank\">駛khah慢--leh！</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">14</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">郭伊貞</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_81.html\" target=\"_blank\">時到，花就開</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">16</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林榮淑</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/vs.html\" target=\"_blank\">欲求 vs. 品行</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">17</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雁&nbsp; &nbsp; 翎</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: x-large; white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_8.html\" target=\"_blank\">招弟：（二）伴嫁</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">18</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Sio招來看戲</span></h3><div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳飛豪<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/e-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">李銘宸ê實驗劇場〈超級市場〉：</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: larg